{"name":"多行文本框","description":"多行文本框是让用户输入或编辑多段自由文本的表单控件 · 评论、个人简介和给 AI 的提示词适合使用它，并可显示字数限制。只需要填写昵称等短内容时，普通输入框更直接。 先知道 输入框 Input","quote":"要让用户写一大段话，一行肯定不够。","agentPrompt":"把故障描述改成多行文本框，限制 500 字并实时显示剩余字数。请测试多段文字、达到上限和超出上限时的反馈，不能让内容只在单行里左右滚动。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-textarea\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>多行文本框<span>Textarea</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">要让用户写一大段话，一行肯定不够。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">多行文本框是让用户输入或编辑多段自由文本的表单控件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>评论、个人简介和给 AI 的提示词适合使用它，并可显示字数限制。只需要填写昵称等短内容时，普通输入框更直接。</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"先知道\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">先知道</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input\">输入框 <b>Input</b></a></div></div></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"ta-wrap\"><textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"请描述你遇到的问题，越具体越好…\"></textarea><span class=\"ta-count\">0 / 500</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>把故障描述改成多行文本框，限制 500 字并实时显示剩余字数。请测试多段文字、达到上限和超出上限时的反馈，不能让内容只在单行里左右滚动。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>发表评论、写回复</b>：内容长短不限</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">这段说明清楚，便于理解。</span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">发布</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>个人简介、项目描述</b>：几句话说清一件事</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">这个组件的交互设计得很细致……<i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:90%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>给 AI 写提示词</b>：指令往往又长又具体</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">帮我把这段文案改得更口语化，保留原意……<i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:space-between\"><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">AI</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">生成</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>有字数上限</b>时配上实时计数</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">这个组件的交互设计得很细致……</span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"justify-content:flex-end\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">48 / 500</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">只需填写<b>单行内容</b>：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"input\" aria-label=\"输入框 Input\">输入框 <b>Input</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">标题</span><span class=\"mk-input \">2026 年产品规划 v3</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要从<b>固定选项</b>中选择：使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span style=\"width:34px;color:var(--text-3)\">状态</span><span class=\"mk-select\">进行中<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">需要<b>加粗、插图或排版</b>：使用富文本编辑器</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\">我想把这段话加粗，再插一张图……</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">纯文本框不支持富文本编辑</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">用多行文本框展示只读内容；正文或描述组件更合适</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span class=\"mk-textarea\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:95%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:92%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">一大段只读内容放进灰框，看起来像没填完的表单</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"label\"><span class=\"input-label\">反馈意见</span></span>\n          <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"box\"><textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"请描述你遇到的问题…\"></textarea></span>\n          <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"count\"><span class=\"ta-count\">0 / 200</span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"label\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">标签</span><span class=\"pe\">Label</span></button><span class=\"pd\">告诉用户写哪方面的内容</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"box\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">多行文本框本体</span><span class=\"pe\">Textarea</span></button><span class=\"pd\">提供适合内容的初始高度，是否允许调整按场景决定</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"count\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">字数统计</span><span class=\"pe\">Word Count</span></button><span class=\"pd\">接近上限时变红提醒</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">默认<span>Default</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"请输入…\"></textarea></div><div class=\"variant-when\">评论、反馈等常规多行输入</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带字数统计<span>With Count</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"ta-wrap\"><textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"2\">这个组件的交互设计得很细致，值得学习。</textarea><span class=\"ta-count\">21 / 500</span></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">有字数上限时，显示实时计数</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">只读<span>Readonly</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"2\" readonly>提交后不可修改的内容</textarea></div><div class=\"variant-when\">内容已确定，只展示不让改</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">禁用<span>Disabled</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><textarea class=\"demo-input ta-demo\" rows=\"2\" disabled placeholder=\"暂不可编辑\"></textarea></div><div class=\"variant-when\">整个多行文本框暂时不可编辑</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">评论区输入框</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px\">\n            <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0\" alt=\"\">\n            <div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>阿澈</b> <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">2 小时前</span></div>\n              <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:2px\">评论内容示例</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px\">\n            <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0\" alt=\"\">\n            <div style=\"flex:1\">\n              <textarea class=\"demo-input\" rows=\"2\" style=\"width:100%;resize:none;line-height:1.6;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px\">写得真好，把 hover 的细节都讲清楚了</textarea>\n              <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:6px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">😊 表情</span><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">发布</button></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">个人简介编辑</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n            <img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\">\n            <div><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600\">林小hu</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">编辑个人资料</div></div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:4px\">个人简介</div>\n          <textarea class=\"demo-input\" rows=\"3\" style=\"width:100%;resize:none;line-height:1.6;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px\">正在学习前端和 Vibe Coding，希望把想法快速做成原型。</textarea>\n          <div style=\"text-align:right;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:4px\">26 / 100</div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">AI 对话提示词</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:8px\"><div style=\"max-width:82%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:12px 12px 2px 12px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5\">帮我把这段文案改得更口语化，保留原意，别超过 100 字</div></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-robot.png\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:2px 12px 12px 12px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.5\">好的，这是更口语化的版本……</div></div>\n          <div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:8px 10px;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n            <textarea class=\"demo-input\" rows=\"1\" style=\"width:100%;border:0;padding:2px 4px;resize:none;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px;box-shadow:none\" placeholder=\"继续提问，Shift + Enter 换行\"></textarea>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:2px\"><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">📎 附件</span><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding:5px 14px\">发送</button></div>\n          </div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">意见反馈表单</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:380px;margin:0 auto\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);width:56px;flex-shrink:0;padding-top:5px\">问题类型</span><span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px\"><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">功能异常</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">体验建议</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">其他</span></span></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);width:56px;flex-shrink:0;padding-top:7px\">问题描述</span><textarea class=\"demo-input\" rows=\"3\" style=\"flex:1;resize:none;line-height:1.6;font-family:inherit;font-size:12px\" placeholder=\"请描述你遇到的问题，越具体越好…\"></textarea></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:8px;padding-left:64px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">📎 可上传截图</span><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">提交反馈</button></div>\n        </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/textarea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">&lt;textarea&gt; 多行文本元素</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/textarea","markdown":"# 多行文本框Textarea\n\n你可能会说\n要让用户写一大段话，一行肯定不够。\n\n**多行文本框是让用户输入或编辑多段自由文本的表单控件**·评论、个人简介和给 AI 的提示词适合使用它，并可显示字数限制。只需要填写昵称等短内容时，普通输入框更直接。\n先知道\n[输入框 **Input**](/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh)\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 把故障描述改成多行文本框，限制 500 字并实时显示剩余字数。请测试多段文字、达到上限和超出上限时的反馈，不能让内容只在单行里左右滚动。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- **发表评论、写回复**：内容长短不限\n\n这段说明清楚，便于理解。\n发布\n- **个人简介、项目描述**：几句话说清一件事\n\n这个组件的交互设计得很细致……\n- **给 AI 写提示词**：指令往往又长又具体\n\n帮我把这段文案改得更口语化，保留原意……\nAI生成\n- **有字数上限**时配上实时计数\n\n这个组件的交互设计得很细致……\n48 / 500\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 只需填写**单行内容**：使用 [输入框 **Input**](/vibe-hub/input?lang=zh)\n\n标题2026 年产品规划 v3\n- 需要从**固定选项**中选择：使用 [选择器 **Select**](/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh)\n\n状态进行中\n- 需要**加粗、插图或排版**：使用富文本编辑器\n\n我想把这段话加粗，再插一张图……纯文本框不支持富文本编辑\n- 用多行文本框展示只读内容；正文或描述组件更合适\n\n一大段只读内容放进灰框，看起来像没填完的表单\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n反馈意见\n          \n          0 / 200\n\n1标签Label告诉用户写哪方面的内容\n\n2多行文本框本体Textarea提供适合内容的初始高度，是否允许调整按场景决定\n\n3字数统计Word Count接近上限时变红提醒\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n默认Default\n\n评论、反馈等常规多行输入\n\n带字数统计With Count\n\n这个组件的交互设计得很细致，值得学习。21 / 500\n\n有字数上限时，显示实时计数\n\n只读Readonly\n\n提交后不可修改的内容\n\n内容已确定，只展示不让改\n\n禁用Disabled\n\n整个多行文本框暂时不可编辑\n\n典型使用场景\n\n评论区输入框\n\n**阿澈** 2 小时前\n\n              \n评论内容示例\n\n          \n写得真好，把 hover 的细节都讲清楚了\n              \n😊 表情发布\n\n个人简介编辑\n\n林小hu\n\n编辑个人资料\n\n          \n个人简介\n\n          正在学习前端和 Vibe Coding，希望把想法快速做成原型。\n          \n26 / 100\n\nAI 对话提示词\n\n帮我把这段文案改得更口语化，保留原意，别超过 100 字\n\n          \n好的，这是更口语化的版本……\n\n          \n📎 附件发送\n\n意见反馈表单\n\n问题类型功能异常体验建议其他\n\n          \n问题描述\n\n          \n📎 可上传截图提交反馈\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[<textarea> 多行文本元素MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/textarea)"}